# Update backlog canvas on every ship

Whenever `package.json` **`zukoBuild`** and/or **`version`** is bumped, or a ship is merged/pushed (`main` / `beta-release`, `npm run dist:win:beta`):

1. Mark shipped items in `docs/backlog.md`.
2. Log the build in `docs/working-notes.md`.
3. **Update the planning canvas** so it matches that ship — current version, current build, completed vs next items, and the “shipped since” callout.

Canvas file (open beside chat):

`C:\Users\alexp\.cursor\projects\c-Users-alexp-Projects-zuko-astro-planner\canvases\zuko-backlog-02-vs-03.canvas.tsx`

Canonical list stays `docs/backlog.md`. The canvas is the visual snapshot; do not leave it a build behind.
